{"cards":[7888,9914,10003,10217,10871,11311,11385,11561,11637,11724,11927,12274,12280,12406,12426,12489,12694,12701,12835,12862,13081,13204,13260,13346,13419,13496,13807,14220,14409,15123,15242],"notes":{},"qaData":{"en":{"answer":"The \"Dogmatika\" monster's ATK returns to its original ATK.\n\n~~~\n\nSimilarly, if <<13346>>'s effect is applied to a monster whose ATK was modified by the effect of one of the following monsters, its ATK will return to its original ATK during the next turn:\n● <<14409>>\n● <<11637>>\n● <<15123>>\n● <<10871>>\n● <<13204>>\n● <<12489>>\n● <<11561>>\n● <<13807>>\n● <<7888>>\n● <<12426>>\n● <<12280>>\n● <<11927>>\n● <<12406>>\n● <<12274>>\n● <<12701>>\n● <<13081>>\n● <<12835>>\n● <<11311>>\n● <<12694>>\n● <<10003>>\n● <<11385>>\n● <<12862>>\n● <<11724>>\n● <<10217>>\n● <<9914>>\n● <<14220>>\n● <<13419>>\n● <<13496>>\n● <<13260>>","id":23619,"question":"I control a \"Dogmatika\" monster whose ATK has been increased by 500 by the effect of <<15242>>.\n\nThe effect of <<13346>> applies to that \"Dogmatika\" monster, causing its ATK to become 0. Once the effect of <<13346>> expires at the end of the turn, what will the \"Dogmatika\" monster's ATK become?","thisSrc":{"date":"2022-03-26","misc":"gallantron","type":4},"title":"If <<13346>>'s effect is applied to a monster whose ATK is increased by the effect of <<15242>>, what will that monster's ATK be next turn?","tlSrc":{"date":"2024-12-01","type":0},"translationStatus":"confirmed"},"ja":{"answer":"その「ドラグマ」モンスターの元々の攻撃力に戻ります。\n\n以下のモンスター効果によって攻撃力が変化しているモンスターに「<<13346>>」の効果を適用した場合も同様に、次のターンからはそのモンスターの元々の攻撃力に戻ります。\n「<<14409>>」\n「<<11637>>」\n「<<15123>>」\n「<<10871>>」\n「<<13204>>」\n「<<12489>>」\n「<<11561>>」\n「<<13807>>」\n「<<7888>>」\n「<<12426>>」\n「<<12280>>」\n「<<11927>>」\n「<<12406>>」\n「<<12274>>」\n「<<12701>>」\n「<<13081>>」\n「<<12835>>」\n「<<11311>>」\n「<<12694>>」\n「<<10003>>」\n「<<11385>>」\n「<<12862>>」\n「<<11724>>」\n「<<10217>>」\n「<<9914>>」\n「<<14220>>」\n「<<13419>>」\n「<<13496>>」\n「<<13260>>」","id":23619,"question":"「<<15242>>」の②の効果によって、攻撃力が５００アップしている「ドラグマ」モンスターが「<<13346>>」の①の効果によって攻撃力が０になった場合、次のターンから攻撃力は何になりますか？","thisSrc":{"date":"2024-12-01","type":0},"title":"「<<15242>>」の効果によって攻撃力が変化しているモンスターに「<<13346>>」の効果を適用した場合、次のターンからの攻撃力はどうなりますか？"}},"tags":["k:Monster"],"_meiocg_history_sha":"8ab99799ea7c4679015e94a795a7f2ff016283ef5fa2cf77caf569b70c9e34c2"}